{"id":"vol9-01","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-01/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":393.25,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.44,"text":"Now turn to section 3 on page 5.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.26],["turn",0.26,0.56],["to",0.56,0.8],["section",0.8,1.06],["3",1.06,1.72],["on",1.72,2.42],["page",2.42,2.74],["5.",2.74,3.44]]},{"start":5.83,"end":6.69,"text":"Section 3.","words":[["Section",5.83,6.09],["3.",6.09,6.69]]},{"start":7.47,"end":13.71,"text":"You'll hear two students called Jen and Rob discussing a project they are about to","words":[["You'll",7.47,8.15],["hear",8.15,8.37],["two",8.37,8.75],["students",8.75,9.29],["called",9.29,9.81],["Jen",9.81,10.27],["and",10.27,10.71],["Rob",10.71,11.07],["discussing",11.07,12.03],["a",12.03,12.35],["project",12.35,12.81],["they",12.81,13.13],["are",13.13,13.25],["about",13.25,13.47],["to",13.47,13.71]]},{"start":13.71,"end":14.67,"text":"start working on.","words":[["start",13.71,13.95],["working",13.95,14.31],["on.",14.31,14.67]]},{"start":15.51,"end":21.51,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 24 on page 5.","words":[["First",15.51,16.23],["you",16.23,16.43],["have",16.43,16.59],["some",16.59,16.75],["time",16.75,17.11],["to",17.11,17.39],["look",17.39,17.51],["at",17.51,17.61],["questions",17.61,17.95],["21",17.95,18.77],["to",18.77,18.99],["24",18.99,19.61],["on",19.61,20.53],["page",20.53,20.85],["5.",20.85,21.51]]},{"start":51.96,"end":56.08,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["Now",51.96,52.3],["listen",52.3,52.64],["carefully",52.64,53.06],["and",53.06,53.44],["answer",53.44,53.96],["questions",53.96,54.38],["21",54.38,55.28],["to",55.28,55.52],["24.",55.52,56.08]]},{"start":59.79,"end":60.73,"text":"Hi Jen.","words":[["Hi",59.79,60.37],["Jen.",60.37,60.73]]},{"start":61.05,"end":61.69,"text":"Hi Rob.","words":[["Hi",61.05,61.39],["Rob.",61.39,61.69]]},{"start":61.69,"end":66.13,"text":"Rob, we need to look at this project we're doing together in Forensic Linguistics.","words":[["Rob,",61.69,61.77],["we",62.21,62.49],["need",62.49,62.67],["to",62.67,62.87],["look",62.87,62.99],["at",62.99,63.11],["this",63.11,63.25],["project",63.25,63.63],["we're",63.63,63.99],["doing",63.99,64.27],["together",64.27,64.67],["in",64.67,65.03],["Forensic",65.03,65.55],["Linguistics.",65.55,66.13]]},{"start":66.49,"end":72.15,"text":"Sure. The first thing we have to do is define Forensic Linguistics. I thought we could say","words":[["Sure.",66.49,66.83],["The",67.35,67.63],["first",67.63,67.83],["thing",67.83,67.99],["we",67.99,68.13],["have",68.13,68.31],["to",68.31,68.45],["do",68.45,68.61],["is",68.61,68.79],["define",68.79,69.15],["Forensic",69.15,69.77],["Linguistics.",69.77,70.29],["I",71.13,71.51],["thought",71.51,71.67],["we",71.67,71.81],["could",71.81,71.93],["say",71.93,72.15]]},{"start":72.15,"end":78.83,"text":"something like, Linguistics involves the analysis of language, and Forensic refers to using","words":[["something",72.15,72.47],["like,",72.47,72.81],["Linguistics",73.35,73.87],["involves",73.87,74.37],["the",74.37,74.73],["analysis",74.73,75.23],["of",75.23,75.49],["language,",75.49,75.91],["and",76.61,76.85],["Forensic",76.85,77.53],["refers",77.53,78.09],["to",78.09,78.45],["using",78.45,78.83]]},{"start":78.83,"end":85.57,"text":"scientific techniques to solve crimes. So Forensic Linguistics involves analysing people's","words":[["scientific",78.83,79.47],["techniques",79.47,80.07],["to",80.07,80.35],["solve",80.35,80.67],["crimes.",80.67,81.19],["So",81.91,82.15],["Forensic",82.15,82.73],["Linguistics",82.73,83.29],["involves",83.29,84.11],["analysing",84.11,85.07],["people's",85.07,85.57]]},{"start":85.57,"end":90.55,"text":"use of language to find out whether they've committed a crime. What do you think of","words":[["use",85.57,85.75],["of",85.75,85.95],["language",85.95,86.37],["to",86.37,86.97],["find",86.97,87.25],["out",87.25,87.51],["whether",87.51,87.83],["they've",87.83,88.17],["committed",88.17,88.47],["a",88.47,88.65],["crime.",88.65,89.03],["What",89.77,90.17],["do",90.17,90.27],["you",90.27,90.29],["think",90.29,90.45],["of",90.45,90.55]]},{"start":90.55,"end":91.29,"text":"that as a definition.","words":[["that",90.55,90.67],["as",90.67,90.83],["a",90.83,90.93],["definition.",90.93,91.29]]},{"start":91.81,"end":92.57,"text":"Sounds OK.","words":[["Sounds",91.81,92.19],["OK.",92.19,92.57]]},{"start":93.23,"end":94.79,"text":"I looked it up in my dictionary,","words":[["I",93.23,93.55],["looked",93.55,93.79],["it",93.79,93.99],["up",93.99,94.13],["in",94.13,94.25],["my",94.25,94.39],["dictionary,",94.39,94.79]]},{"start":95.19,"end":96.49,"text":"and I got something similar.","words":[["and",95.19,95.41],["I",95.41,95.67],["got",95.67,95.81],["something",95.81,96.13],["similar.",96.13,96.49]]},{"start":97.19,"end":99.93,"text":"Then we can add something about what forensic linguists","words":[["Then",97.19,97.39],["we",97.39,97.53],["can",97.53,97.69],["add",97.69,97.85],["something",97.85,98.19],["about",98.19,98.53],["what",98.53,98.75],["forensic",98.75,99.21],["linguists",99.21,99.93]]},{"start":99.93,"end":101.67,"text":"actually do to back it up.","words":[["actually",99.93,100.41],["do",100.41,100.85],["to",100.85,101.15],["back",101.15,101.33],["it",101.33,101.45],["up.",101.45,101.67]]},{"start":102.21,"end":105.15,"text":"You know, like analyzing documents to find out","words":[["You",102.21,102.37],["know,",102.37,102.53],["like",102.89,103.07],["analyzing",103.07,103.57],["documents",103.57,104.31],["to",104.31,104.71],["find",104.71,104.93],["out",104.93,105.15]]},{"start":105.15,"end":105.89,"text":"who wrote them.","words":[["who",105.15,105.39],["wrote",105.39,105.63],["them.",105.63,105.89]]},{"start":106.21,"end":106.63,"text":"Good point.","words":[["Good",106.21,106.37],["point.",106.37,106.63]]},{"start":107.15,"end":107.81,"text":"Let's do that.","words":[["Let's",107.15,107.43],["do",107.43,107.59],["that.",107.59,107.81]]},{"start":108.41,"end":110.27,"text":"What about the actual project?","words":[["What",108.41,108.81],["about",108.81,109.09],["the",109.09,109.35],["actual",109.35,109.75],["project?",109.75,110.27]]},{"start":110.91,"end":113.83,"text":"I'm glad we chose voice identification as the topic.","words":[["I'm",110.91,111.13],["glad",111.13,111.35],["we",111.35,111.61],["chose",111.61,111.93],["voice",111.93,112.23],["identification",112.23,112.87],["as",112.87,113.37],["the",113.37,113.51],["topic.",113.51,113.83]]},{"start":114.39,"end":114.71,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",114.39,114.71]]},{"start":115.19,"end":117.69,"text":"We've been given a voice recording of a possible suspect,","words":[["We've",115.19,115.43],["been",115.43,115.57],["given",115.57,115.77],["a",115.77,115.95],["voice",115.95,116.13],["recording",116.13,116.55],["of",116.55,116.75],["a",116.75,116.87],["possible",116.87,117.17],["suspect,",117.17,117.69]]},{"start":118.17,"end":119.71,"text":"not a real suspect, of course.","words":[["not",118.17,118.35],["a",118.35,118.51],["real",118.51,118.77],["suspect,",118.77,119.25],["of",119.49,119.53],["course.",119.53,119.71]]},{"start":119.71,"end":124.79,"text":"so we've got to listen to the recording and analyze their voice. Should be okay?","words":[["so",119.71,120.23],["we've",120.23,120.79],["got",120.79,120.87],["to",120.87,121.05],["listen",121.05,121.21],["to",121.21,121.37],["the",121.37,121.49],["recording",121.49,121.83],["and",121.83,122.27],["analyze",122.27,122.73],["their",122.73,123.09],["voice.",123.09,123.39],["Should",123.89,124.39],["be",124.39,124.55],["okay?",124.55,124.79]]},{"start":125.33,"end":129.73,"text":"Well I've already listened to the recording and I can't even tell if it's a","words":[["Well",125.33,125.67],["I've",125.67,126.27],["already",126.27,126.49],["listened",126.49,126.83],["to",126.83,127.07],["the",127.07,127.17],["recording",127.17,127.59],["and",127.59,128.27],["I",128.27,128.45],["can't",128.45,128.75],["even",128.75,128.95],["tell",128.95,129.31],["if",129.31,129.49],["it's",129.49,129.63],["a",129.63,129.73]]},{"start":129.73,"end":135.27,"text":"man or a woman but I guess that doesn't matter. The accent's a local one though","words":[["man",129.73,129.99],["or",129.99,130.19],["a",130.19,130.29],["woman",130.29,130.63],["but",130.63,131.43],["I",131.43,131.85],["guess",131.85,131.97],["that",131.97,132.17],["doesn't",132.17,132.39],["matter.",132.39,132.71],["The",133.39,133.57],["accent's",133.57,134.05],["a",134.05,134.11],["local",134.11,134.37],["one",134.37,134.73],["though",134.73,135.27]]},{"start":135.27,"end":139.89,"text":"I'm not sure how that will affect anything. Where we're really going to get in","words":[["I'm",135.27,135.61],["not",135.61,135.75],["sure",135.75,135.99],["how",135.99,136.29],["that",136.29,136.47],["will",136.47,136.61],["affect",136.61,136.93],["anything.",136.93,137.39],["Where",138.13,138.55],["we're",138.55,138.83],["really",138.83,139.15],["going",139.15,139.41],["to",139.41,139.57],["get",139.57,139.73],["in",139.73,139.89]]},{"start":139.89,"end":143.83,"text":"trouble is that the recording is very unclear. I'm sure they've done that","words":[["trouble",139.89,140.21],["is",140.21,140.55],["that",140.55,140.69],["the",140.69,140.79],["recording",140.79,141.15],["is",141.15,141.35],["very",141.35,141.55],["unclear.",141.55,142.01],["I'm",142.73,143.03],["sure",143.03,143.21],["they've",143.21,143.49],["done",143.49,143.63],["that",143.63,143.83]]},{"start":143.83,"end":148.77,"text":"to test us. Well they weren't going to make it easy. We have to analyze the","words":[["to",143.83,144.01],["test",144.01,144.33],["us.",144.33,144.65],["Well",144.95,145.25],["they",145.25,145.45],["weren't",145.45,145.69],["going",145.69,145.81],["to",145.81,145.97],["make",145.97,146.13],["it",146.13,146.23],["easy.",146.23,146.59],["We",147.35,147.69],["have",147.69,147.93],["to",147.93,148.09],["analyze",148.09,148.47],["the",148.47,148.77]]},{"start":148.77,"end":153.83,"text":"voice sample with that spectrograph instrument, don't we? Learning what to do with it is","words":[["voice",148.77,148.99],["sample",148.99,149.45],["with",149.45,149.99],["that",149.99,150.19],["spectrograph",150.19,151.03],["instrument,",151.03,151.59],["don't",151.73,151.83],["we?",151.83,152.09],["Learning",152.59,152.83],["what",152.83,153.07],["to",153.07,153.27],["do",153.27,153.39],["with",153.39,153.53],["it",153.53,153.67],["is",153.67,153.83]]},{"start":153.83,"end":156.41,"text":"the only thing that really concerns me about this project.","words":[["the",153.83,153.99],["only",153.99,154.19],["thing",154.19,154.41],["that",154.41,154.57],["really",154.57,154.77],["concerns",154.77,155.19],["me",155.19,155.55],["about",155.55,155.77],["this",155.77,155.97],["project.",155.97,156.41]]},{"start":156.85,"end":157.63,"text":"It'll be fine.","words":[["It'll",156.85,157.17],["be",157.17,157.31],["fine.",157.31,157.63]]},{"start":158.07,"end":163.49,"text":"Hmm, I guess so. And then we have to interview the suspect and make our own recording face","words":[["Hmm,",158.07,158.35],["I",158.51,158.63],["guess",158.63,158.75],["so.",158.75,159.07],["And",159.85,160.07],["then",160.07,160.19],["we",160.19,160.33],["have",160.33,160.47],["to",160.47,160.59],["interview",160.59,160.93],["the",160.93,161.11],["suspect",161.11,161.41],["and",161.41,162.03],["make",162.03,162.19],["our",162.19,162.41],["own",162.41,162.67],["recording",162.67,163.11],["face",163.11,163.49]]},{"start":163.49,"end":167.83,"text":"to face and decide if it's the same person as on the original recording, right?","words":[["to",163.49,163.71],["face",163.71,164.05],["and",164.05,164.61],["decide",164.61,164.91],["if",164.91,165.07],["it's",165.07,165.23],["the",165.23,165.35],["same",165.35,165.61],["person",165.61,166.09],["as",166.09,166.39],["on",166.39,166.53],["the",166.53,166.65],["original",166.65,167.03],["recording,",167.03,167.43],["right?",167.43,167.83]]},{"start":168.31,"end":174.49,"text":"Yes. It's not an exact science but it's usually pretty accurate. You can often tell","words":[["Yes.",168.31,168.65],["It's",169.15,169.49],["not",169.49,169.65],["an",169.65,169.83],["exact",169.83,170.13],["science",170.13,170.79],["but",170.79,171.09],["it's",171.09,171.43],["usually",171.43,171.93],["pretty",171.93,172.31],["accurate.",172.31,172.87],["You",173.47,173.73],["can",173.73,173.85],["often",173.85,174.09],["tell",174.09,174.49]]},{"start":174.49,"end":179.39,"text":"even when they've got a cold. It's the same person, but they might do something like speaking with","words":[["even",174.49,174.79],["when",174.79,174.97],["they've",174.97,175.15],["got",175.15,175.25],["a",175.25,175.39],["cold.",175.39,175.75],["It's",176.19,176.33],["the",176.33,176.43],["same",176.43,176.61],["person,",176.61,177.03],["but",177.21,177.39],["they",177.39,177.81],["might",177.81,177.95],["do",177.95,178.13],["something",178.13,178.41],["like",178.41,178.73],["speaking",178.73,179.13],["with",179.13,179.39]]},{"start":179.39,"end":184.31,"text":"another accent because the tutor suggests they do that just to test us. So let's get on with it then.","words":[["another",179.39,179.61],["accent",179.61,180.03],["because",180.03,180.37],["the",180.37,180.59],["tutor",180.59,180.77],["suggests",180.77,181.19],["they",181.19,181.55],["do",181.55,181.77],["that",181.77,181.97],["just",181.97,182.17],["to",182.17,182.33],["test",182.33,182.55],["us.",182.55,182.83],["So",183.15,183.39],["let's",183.39,183.65],["get",183.65,183.75],["on",183.75,183.91],["with",183.91,184.03],["it",184.03,184.11],["then.",184.11,184.31]]},{"start":184.77,"end":190.79,"text":"Oh, and don't start your usual self-doubt about whether you can do the work or not. You usually","words":[["Oh,",184.77,185.09],["and",185.47,185.71],["don't",185.71,186.01],["start",186.01,186.27],["your",186.27,186.49],["usual",186.49,186.91],["self",186.91,187.25],["-doubt",187.25,187.73],["about",187.73,188.27],["whether",188.27,188.59],["you",188.59,188.81],["can",188.81,188.99],["do",188.99,189.15],["the",189.15,189.29],["work",189.29,189.55],["or",189.55,189.73],["not.",189.73,189.93],["You",190.33,190.51],["usually",190.51,190.79]]},{"start":190.79,"end":195.35,"text":"do okay in the end. I reckon that as long as we focus on the main points of the assignment,","words":[["do",190.79,191.03],["okay",191.03,191.33],["in",191.33,191.49],["the",191.49,191.59],["end.",191.59,191.87],["I",192.71,192.87],["reckon",192.87,193.11],["that",193.11,193.27],["as",193.27,193.37],["long",193.37,193.49],["as",193.49,193.63],["we",193.63,193.73],["focus",193.73,194.01],["on",194.01,194.21],["the",194.21,194.29],["main",194.29,194.49],["points",194.49,194.77],["of",194.77,194.91],["the",194.91,195.01],["assignment,",195.01,195.35]]},{"start":195.75,"end":200.89,"text":"we can think about the finer details later. My problem is creating things to worry about","words":[["we",195.75,195.99],["can",195.99,196.17],["think",196.17,196.37],["about",196.37,196.53],["the",196.53,196.69],["finer",196.69,196.99],["details",196.99,197.31],["later.",197.31,197.79],["My",198.71,199.01],["problem",199.01,199.33],["is",199.33,199.53],["creating",199.53,199.85],["things",199.85,200.21],["to",200.21,200.41],["worry",200.41,200.61],["about",200.61,200.89]]},{"start":200.89,"end":207.73,"text":"before I've even started. Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["before",200.89,201.13],["I've",201.13,201.43],["even",201.43,201.61],["started.",201.61,202.07],["Before",205.77,206.07],["you",206.07,206.35],["hear",206.35,206.65],["the",206.65,206.83],["rest",206.83,207.11],["of",207.11,207.23],["the",207.23,207.31],["discussion,",207.31,207.73]]},{"start":208.31,"end":247.7,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 25-30 on page 6. Now listen and answer questions 25-30.","words":[["you",208.31,208.51],["have",208.51,208.73],["some",208.73,208.93],["time",208.93,209.39],["to",209.39,209.67],["look",209.67,209.81],["at",209.81,209.93],["questions",209.93,210.25],["25",210.25,211.17],["-30",211.17,211.85],["on",211.85,212.57],["page",212.57,212.89],["6.",212.89,213.45],["Now",244.26,244.54],["listen",244.54,244.88],["and",244.88,245.26],["answer",245.26,245.7],["questions",245.7,246.14],["25",246.14,247.12],["-30.",247.12,247.7]]},{"start":251.23,"end":256.27,"text":"We'll have to do some background reading first. I'll go to the library later and get what","words":[["We'll",251.23,251.67],["have",251.67,251.83],["to",251.83,251.99],["do",251.99,252.13],["some",252.13,252.31],["background",252.31,252.69],["reading",252.69,253.13],["first.",253.13,253.59],["I'll",254.19,254.47],["go",254.47,254.59],["to",254.59,254.73],["the",254.73,254.83],["library",254.83,255.05],["later",255.05,255.55],["and",255.55,255.99],["get",255.99,256.13],["what",256.13,256.27]]},{"start":256.27,"end":260.11,"text":"we need. Okay. I've already looked at forensics today","words":[["we",256.27,256.41],["need.",256.41,256.65],["Okay.",257.01,257.37],["I've",258.13,258.45],["already",258.45,258.77],["looked",258.77,259.01],["at",259.01,259.19],["forensics",259.19,259.67],["today",259.67,260.11]]},{"start":260.11,"end":265.91,"text":"and I didn't say much about voice identification so we needn't bother with that one. Language","words":[["and",260.11,260.79],["I",260.79,260.89],["didn't",260.89,261.13],["say",261.13,261.31],["much",261.31,261.57],["about",261.57,261.77],["voice",261.77,262.11],["identification",262.11,262.77],["so",262.77,263.39],["we",263.39,263.73],["needn't",263.73,264.09],["bother",264.09,264.25],["with",264.25,264.45],["that",264.45,264.59],["one.",264.59,264.77],["Language",265.39,265.91]]},{"start":265.91,"end":268.35,"text":"which in crime looks a bit more promising, doesn't it?","words":[["which",265.91,266.03],["in",266.03,266.21],["crime",266.21,266.63],["looks",266.63,266.99],["a",266.99,267.17],["bit",267.17,267.25],["more",267.25,267.45],["promising,",267.45,267.85],["doesn't",268.01,268.17],["it?",268.17,268.35]]},{"start":268.77,"end":270.41,"text":"I've got that out of the library already,","words":[["I've",268.77,268.99],["got",268.99,269.09],["that",269.09,269.23],["out",269.23,269.43],["of",269.43,269.55],["the",269.55,269.63],["library",269.63,269.93],["already,",269.93,270.41]]},{"start":270.41,"end":272.59,"text":"so we don't need to worry about borrowing that.","words":[["so",270.41,270.83],["we",270.83,270.95],["don't",270.95,271.09],["need",271.09,271.25],["to",271.25,271.41],["worry",271.41,271.57],["about",271.57,271.83],["borrowing",271.83,272.19],["that.",272.19,272.59]]},{"start":273.25,"end":275.73,"text":"Research methods in forensic linguistics.","words":[["Research",273.25,273.73],["methods",273.73,274.21],["in",274.21,274.53],["forensic",274.53,274.91],["linguistics.",274.91,275.73]]},{"start":276.49,"end":277.89,"text":"I guess we ought to borrow that.","words":[["I",276.49,276.67],["guess",276.67,276.85],["we",276.85,277.07],["ought",277.07,277.17],["to",277.17,277.33],["borrow",277.33,277.57],["that.",277.57,277.89]]},{"start":278.53,"end":281.35,"text":"And voice identification will be a useful one.","words":[["And",278.53,278.93],["voice",278.93,279.33],["identification",279.33,280.15],["will",280.15,280.55],["be",280.55,280.67],["a",280.67,280.75],["useful",280.75,281.03],["one.",281.03,281.35]]},{"start":281.99,"end":283.87,"text":"I'll borrow that from our classmate, George.","words":[["I'll",281.99,282.23],["borrow",282.23,282.45],["that",282.45,282.67],["from",282.67,282.85],["our",282.85,282.99],["classmate,",282.99,283.49],["George.",283.63,283.87]]},{"start":284.29,"end":285.61,"text":"He won't need it for his project.","words":[["He",284.29,284.47],["won't",284.47,284.63],["need",284.63,284.81],["it",284.81,284.95],["for",284.95,285.07],["his",285.07,285.21],["project.",285.21,285.61]]},{"start":286.15,"end":288.77,"text":"But we should get out modern forensic techniques.","words":[["But",286.15,286.39],["we",286.39,286.53],["should",286.53,286.77],["get",286.77,286.97],["out",286.97,287.27],["modern",287.27,287.71],["forensic",287.71,288.17],["techniques.",288.17,288.77]]},{"start":289.31,"end":291.57,"text":"We need all the help we can get on that subject.","words":[["We",289.31,289.55],["need",289.55,289.75],["all",289.75,290.05],["the",290.05,290.17],["help",290.17,290.35],["we",290.35,290.53],["can",290.53,290.67],["get",290.67,290.85],["on",290.85,291.07],["that",291.07,291.23],["subject.",291.23,291.57]]},{"start":291.93,"end":293.69,"text":"Okay, that's that sorted out.","words":[["Okay,",291.93,292.33],["that's",292.59,292.85],["that",292.85,293.03],["sorted",293.03,293.37],["out.",293.37,293.69]]},{"start":293.69,"end":295.57,"text":"And now on to the practical stuff.","words":[["And",293.69,293.77],["now",293.77,294.27],["on",294.27,294.53],["to",294.53,294.65],["the",294.65,294.75],["practical",294.75,295.09],["stuff.",295.09,295.57]]},{"start":296.55,"end":298.99,"text":"I'm not sure about how we're going to record the voices.","words":[["I'm",296.55,296.79],["not",296.79,296.97],["sure",296.97,297.21],["about",297.21,297.43],["how",297.43,297.75],["we're",297.75,297.97],["going",297.97,298.07],["to",298.07,298.21],["record",298.21,298.53],["the",298.53,298.67],["voices.",298.67,298.99]]},{"start":299.71,"end":301.71,"text":"I'm not too good on the technical side of things.","words":[["I'm",299.71,299.93],["not",299.93,300.09],["too",300.09,300.27],["good",300.27,300.45],["on",300.45,300.59],["the",300.59,300.67],["technical",300.67,301.01],["side",301.01,301.35],["of",301.35,301.45],["things.",301.45,301.71]]},{"start":302.09,"end":302.75,"text":"Me neither.","words":[["Me",302.09,302.29],["neither.",302.29,302.75]]},{"start":303.21,"end":304.73,"text":"We'd better work out what we're doing.","words":[["We'd",303.21,303.43],["better",303.43,303.65],["work",303.65,303.91],["out",303.91,304.09],["what",304.09,304.25],["we're",304.25,304.45],["doing.",304.45,304.73]]},{"start":305.39,"end":309.19,"text":"At least we get more than one opportunity to speak to the person playing the suspect.","words":[["At",305.39,305.53],["least",305.53,305.77],["we",305.77,305.95],["get",305.95,306.11],["more",306.11,306.37],["than",306.37,306.53],["one",306.53,306.71],["opportunity",306.71,307.25],["to",307.25,307.49],["speak",307.49,307.75],["to",307.75,307.93],["the",307.93,308.01],["person",308.01,308.37],["playing",308.37,308.67],["the",308.67,308.85],["suspect.",308.85,309.19]]},{"start":309.95,"end":313.31,"text":"I just hope whoever it is won't make the task too tricky.","words":[["I",309.95,310.13],["just",310.13,310.35],["hope",310.35,310.73],["whoever",310.73,311.05],["it",311.05,311.37],["is",311.37,311.69],["won't",311.69,312.03],["make",312.03,312.17],["the",312.17,312.31],["task",312.31,312.65],["too",312.65,312.93],["tricky.",312.93,313.31]]},{"start":313.71,"end":317.77,"text":"I'm sure they won't be too hard on us, and as long as we do our research properly,","words":[["I'm",313.71,313.91],["sure",313.91,314.13],["they",314.13,314.29],["won't",314.29,314.47],["be",314.47,314.57],["too",314.57,314.77],["hard",314.77,315.03],["on",315.03,315.19],["us,",315.19,315.39],["and",316.01,316.23],["as",316.23,316.41],["long",316.41,316.53],["as",316.53,316.67],["we",316.67,316.77],["do",316.77,316.89],["our",316.89,317.01],["research",317.01,317.37],["properly,",317.37,317.77]]},{"start":318.09,"end":319.99,"text":"it shouldn't be too hard to do the rest of it.","words":[["it",318.09,318.23],["shouldn't",318.23,318.49],["be",318.49,318.61],["too",318.61,318.85],["hard",318.85,319.15],["to",319.15,319.35],["do",319.35,319.43],["the",319.43,319.53],["rest",319.53,319.73],["of",319.73,319.85],["it.",319.85,319.99]]},{"start":320.67,"end":322.93,"text":"I'm more worried about fitting in the writing up.","words":[["I'm",320.67,321.05],["more",321.05,321.21],["worried",321.21,321.47],["about",321.47,321.67],["fitting",321.67,322.03],["in",322.03,322.27],["the",322.27,322.35],["writing",322.35,322.61],["up.",322.61,322.93]]},{"start":322.93,"end":326.87,"text":"I know. We've got loads of other assignments to finish as well.","words":[["I",322.93,323.41],["know.",323.41,323.71],["We've",324.23,324.53],["got",324.53,324.67],["loads",324.67,324.99],["of",324.99,325.21],["other",325.21,325.39],["assignments",325.39,325.83],["to",325.83,326.19],["finish",326.19,326.39],["as",326.39,326.59],["well.",326.59,326.87]]},{"start":327.87,"end":331.63,"text":"Now Rob, let's decide how we're going to split the writing between us.","words":[["Now",327.87,328.11],["Rob,",328.11,328.39],["let's",328.73,329.03],["decide",329.03,329.41],["how",329.41,329.71],["we're",329.71,329.85],["going",329.85,329.99],["to",329.99,330.15],["split",330.15,330.45],["the",330.45,330.67],["writing",330.67,330.93],["between",330.93,331.23],["us.",331.23,331.63]]},{"start":332.29,"end":335.75,"text":"Are you any good at introductions? They always seem to let me down.","words":[["Are",332.29,332.41],["you",332.41,332.55],["any",332.55,332.73],["good",332.73,332.91],["at",332.91,333.03],["introductions?",333.03,333.59],["They",334.37,334.59],["always",334.59,334.81],["seem",334.81,334.97],["to",334.97,335.11],["let",335.11,335.23],["me",335.23,335.35],["down.",335.35,335.75]]},{"start":336.05,"end":340.21,"text":"Okay, leave that to me. Are you okay to do the literature review then?","words":[["Okay,",336.05,336.39],["leave",336.61,336.77],["that",336.77,336.99],["to",336.99,337.15],["me.",337.15,337.33],["Are",338.17,338.43],["you",338.43,338.57],["okay",338.57,338.83],["to",338.83,339.03],["do",339.03,339.15],["the",339.15,339.29],["literature",339.29,339.57],["review",339.57,339.95],["then?",339.95,340.21]]},{"start":340.67,"end":344.69,"text":"Maybe we should split that part. I don't mind writing the methodology section","words":[["Maybe",340.67,341.01],["we",341.01,341.19],["should",341.19,341.35],["split",341.35,341.63],["that",341.63,341.85],["part.",341.85,342.09],["I",342.65,342.81],["don't",342.81,342.99],["mind",342.99,343.19],["writing",343.19,343.57],["the",343.57,343.75],["methodology",343.75,344.21],["section",344.21,344.69]]},{"start":344.69,"end":347.49,"text":"if you feel comfortable doing the discussion and conclusions.","words":[["if",344.69,345.11],["you",345.11,345.23],["feel",345.23,345.43],["comfortable",345.43,345.81],["doing",345.81,346.13],["the",346.13,346.33],["discussion",346.33,346.75],["and",346.75,347.11],["conclusions.",347.11,347.49]]},{"start":348.03,"end":351.41,"text":"Okay. And we can do the analysis between us as well.","words":[["Okay.",348.03,348.43],["And",349.07,349.39],["we",349.39,349.53],["can",349.53,349.65],["do",349.65,349.81],["the",349.81,349.97],["analysis",349.97,350.47],["between",350.47,350.85],["us",350.85,351.09],["as",351.09,351.21],["well.",351.21,351.41]]},{"start":351.41,"end":353.23,"text":"Great. Let's get started.","words":[["Great.",351.41,352.07],["Let's",352.55,352.77],["get",352.77,352.85],["started.",352.85,353.23]]},{"start":356.82,"end":359.08,"text":"That is the end of section 3.","words":[["That",356.82,357.38],["is",357.38,357.52],["the",357.52,357.68],["end",357.68,358.08],["of",358.08,358.28],["section",358.28,358.52],["3.",358.52,359.08]]},{"start":359.9,"end":362.76,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",359.9,360.12],["now",360.12,360.4],["have",360.4,360.74],["half",360.74,361.1],["a",361.1,361.32],["minute",361.32,361.54],["to",361.54,361.88],["check",361.88,362.2],["your",362.2,362.4],["answers.",362.4,362.76]]}]}